
### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 2. Create a product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nike Airforce",
  "description": "Premium Casual shoes",
  "price": 2999,
  "stock": 10
}

### 3. Get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products


### 4. Get one product
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30

### 5. Update the product price
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/products/6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 9999
}

### 6. Delete the product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30


//! Order Api test 

### Create an order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test Customer",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "6addbbb493dd72ed021a6a30",
      "quantity": 10
    }
  ]
}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders

### Get one order
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/6addbc2493dd72ed021a6a32

### Update order status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/orders/6addbc2493dd72ed021a6a32/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "cancelled"
}


